2068
01:12:12,293 --> 01:12:14,163
- Nice. A dehumidifier.
- That's a nice one.

2069
01:12:16,163 --> 01:12:17,403
Gosh. A dehumidifier.

2070
01:12:18,063 --> 01:12:19,203
Gosh. That's a nice one.

2071
01:12:19,373 --> 01:12:22,543
