2079
01:12:36,683 --> 01:12:38,643
It was bought with the taxes of Incheon citizens.

2080
01:12:38,853 --> 01:12:40,292
- He's from Incheon.
- He's an Incheon citizen.

2081
01:12:40,293 --> 01:12:41,492
He still lives in Incheon.

2082
01:12:41,493 --> 01:12:43,323
- Really?
- It was bought with the taxes.

2083
01:12:44,993 --> 01:12:46,233
You should try playing it.

2084
01:12:47,033 --> 01:12:48,503
