2101
01:13:28,003 --> 01:13:30,773
(With the tennis balls, )

2102
01:13:31,913 --> 01:13:32,913
(they threw them, )

2103
01:13:32,914 --> 01:13:34,172
(smashed them, )

2104
01:13:34,173 --> 01:13:35,742
(blew them, )

2105
01:13:35,743 --> 01:13:37,213
