- Gosh.
- What if this happens?

2114
01:13:56,533 --> 01:13:57,853
All of the balls must be removed.

2115
01:13:58,163 --> 01:13:59,203
- What?
- I see.

2116
01:13:59,333 --> 01:14:00,879
- All of the balls must be removed.
- I see.

2117
01:14:00,903 --> 01:14:01,942
