2132
01:14:31,503 --> 01:14:33,373
It's hard when there's one ball left.

2133
01:14:33,603 --> 01:14:35,142
- Right.
- One ball left.

2134
01:14:35,143 --> 01:14:36,143
Right.

2135
01:14:36,144 --> 01:14:37,402
It's hard when there's one ball left.

2136
