2184
01:16:14,573 --> 01:16:16,073
- All right. We did well.
- Hold on.

2185
01:16:16,343 --> 01:16:18,873
All right. Let's do well.

2186
01:16:20,873 --> 01:16:23,743
A one-day coffee truck for the 100 members of...

2187
01:16:23,843 --> 01:16:25,882
the Incheon Philharmonic Orchestra who march every day.

2188
