2516
01:28:40,052 --> 01:28:41,782
(Hooray!)

2517
01:28:43,122 --> 01:28:45,652
- Round 2, success!
- Round 2, success!

2518
01:28:47,992 --> 01:28:50,192
- Gosh, we did it!
- Gosh!

2519
01:28:50,492 --> 01:28:51,891
- We did it!
- We did it!

2520
01:28:51,892 --> 01:28:53,362
- All right. We did it!
- All right.

2521
01:28:53,632 --> 01:28:55,731
- All right.
- So...

2522
01:28:55,732 --> 01:28:57,432
Round Two was a success.

2523
01:28:57,902 --> 01:28:59,172
You can stop now.

2524
01:29:01,402 --> 01:29:03,541
- Well, there's 1 try left.
- There's 1 try left.

2525
01:29:03,542 --> 01:29:05,372
Well, it's quite obvious.

2526
01:29:05,712 --> 01:29:07,181
- All right.
- You will lose everything.

2527
01:29:07,182 --> 01:29:08,942
- Stopping here is the best choice.
- Right.

2528
01:29:11,012 --> 01:29:12,051
Should I open it?

2529
01:29:12,052 --> 01:29:13,652
(Should I open the present for Round 3?)

2530
01:29:15,452 --> 01:29:16,522
But...

2531
01:29:17,292 --> 01:29:18,692
- You're not going to stop?
- Wait.

2532
01:29:19,662 --> 01:29:21,622
- There's one try left!
- You'll lose everything.

2533
01:29:21,692 --> 01:29:23,391
- But...
- You should stop here!

2534
01:29:23,392 --> 01:29:25,032
- You know that, don't you?
- Stop here!

2535
01:29:25,132 --> 01:29:27,061
There's one try left.

2536
01:29:27,062 --> 01:29:28,742
- Feel free to decide.
- We might make it.

2537
01:29:28,862 --> 01:29:30,402
Decide if you will stop or go.

2538
01:29:30,772 --> 01:29:31,772
Just a moment, please.

2539
01:29:33,072 --> 01:29:34,572
- Where is he going?
- Gosh.

2540
01:29:34,642 --> 01:29:36,482
I got so surprised after seeing him try to go.

2541
01:29:37,612 --> 01:29:38,642
Is someone there?

2542
01:29:39,482 --> 01:29:41,181
It's the instrument master.

2543
01:29:41,182 --> 01:29:42,411
- Right.
- I see. You talked with...

2544
01:29:42,412 --> 01:29:44,311
- the instrument master.
- Please make your decision.

2545
01:29:44,312 --> 01:29:45,751
(He talked with the master about whether to go or stop.)

2546
01:29:45,752 --> 01:29:47,122
One, two, three.

2547
01:29:47,352 --> 01:29:48,352
Stop.

2548
01:29:50,692 --> 01:29:52,421
I got so surprised.

2549
01:29:52,422 --> 01:29:53,822
- I got so surprised.
- Gosh.

2550
01:29:54,162 --> 01:29:55,861
- As a result, - Great work, everyone.

2551
01:29:55,862 --> 01:29:58,592
You will be given the presents for Round 1 and Round 2!

2552
01:29:58,932 --> 01:30:00,262
Thank you!

2553
01:30:01,302 --> 01:30:02,401
That was great.

2554
01:30:02,402 --> 01:30:04,401
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

2555
01:30:04,402 --> 01:30:06,378
(The merchandise gets delivered with a delighted heart.)

2556
01:30:06,402 --> 01:30:08,171
- You can never know.
- Thank you.

2557
01:30:08,172 --> 01:30:09,411
(The great performance helped them as well.)

2558
01:30:09,412 --> 01:30:11,741
We were able to...

2559
01:30:11,742 --> 01:30:13,841
- We did it.
- make it in the end.

2560
01:30:13,842 --> 01:30:15,982
- I feel very proud.
- Right.

2561
01:30:18,352 --> 01:30:19,922
Gosh, that was like a drama.

2562
01:30:20,052 --> 01:30:22,791
We had the two stars of "Tazza."

2563
01:30:22,792 --> 01:30:23,821
It was an exciting day today.

2564
01:30:23,822 --> 01:30:25,352
- I had a blast.
- I had so much fun.

2565
01:30:25,392 --> 01:30:26,991
I've only watched the show on TV.

2566
01:30:26,992 --> 01:30:29,262
It was a great experience...

2567
01:30:29,532 --> 01:30:30,731
to meet many different people.

2568
01:30:30,732 --> 01:30:32,031
- I feel energized.
- Right.

2569
01:30:32,032 --> 01:30:33,231
I'll continue to work hard before I see you again.

2570
01:30:33,232 --> 01:30:35,162
Great. The Son of Incheon.

2571
01:30:35,332 --> 01:30:36,332
And you, Jae Won?

2572
01:30:36,333 --> 01:30:38,132
It was a great experience.

2573
01:30:38,432 --> 01:30:40,071
I've spent a happy day today.

2574
01:30:40,072 --> 01:30:42,641
I'll continue to work hard before I see you again. Bye!

2575
01:30:42,642 --> 01:30:43,642
(He copies his line.)

2576
01:30:44,242 --> 01:30:45,842
The reason I stopped...

2577
01:30:45,982 --> 01:30:48,611
was to thank the members...

2578
01:30:48,612 --> 01:30:50,712
who helped out with the shoot.

2579
01:30:51,552 --> 01:30:54,121
We will enjoy the drinks together.

2580
01:30:54,122 --> 01:30:55,451
(He shared the joy with his fellow members.)

2581
01:30:55,452 --> 01:30:56,492
Whenever Possible!

2582
01:31:01,322 --> 01:31:03,722
(Why won't a single one come when it says it's coming soon?)

2583
01:31:04,232 --> 01:31:10,002
(The town with a never-ending wait)

2584
01:31:11,102 --> 01:31:13,371
(This is South Chungcheong Province!)

2585
01:31:13,372 --> 01:31:16,042
(Is that why?)

2586
01:31:16,142 --> 01:31:20,042
(Whenever Possible in Chungcheong Province)

2587
01:31:20,342 --> 01:31:23,982
