2590
01:31:30,592 --> 01:31:33,692
(The one who looks like an uncle during the holidays)

2591
01:31:33,862 --> 01:31:37,031
(Yoo Jae Myung, the one younger than Jae Seok)

2592
01:31:37,032 --> 01:31:38,232
What?

2593
01:31:38,362 --> 01:31:41,702
(The one younger by a year is polite.)

2594
01:31:42,062 --> 01:31:45,201
(It's hard for Jae Seok to call him comfortably.)

2595
01:31:45,202 --> 01:31:49,372
(The unexpected charms of the younger one)

2596
01:31:50,012 --> 01:31:51,842
(Run!)

2597
01:31:52,072 --> 01:31:53,781
(The carefree ones from Chungcheong are forced to run...)

2598
01:31:53,782 --> 01:31:56,352
(and put in shock.)

2599
01:31:56,482 --> 01:31:58,382
(That man's challenge)

2600
01:31:58,582 --> 01:32:00,822
(There's no time to be carefree...)

2601
01:32:01,022 --> 01:32:04,822
(during Cheonan's spare time.)

2602
01:32:04,892 --> 01:32:08,362
(Whenever Possible Season 5)
